    new "Murzilka — a Soviet and Russian monthly illustrated magazine for kids. It has been published since 1924. The magazine uses an unidentified yellow creature wearing a scarf and a red beret as its mascot. Writers like Samuil Marshak and Agniya Barto contributed to the magazine early in their careers."


